cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this model, please cite it.
title: "Iris 9: an offline plant species classifier"
abstract: >-
  A MobileNetV3-Large classifier over 1,569 plant species, exported to
  TensorFlow Lite for on-device inference, trained on about 992,000
  openly licensed photographs from GBIF, iNaturalist and Wikimedia Commons.
authors:
